# packages/agent-sdk — Agent SDK

Owners: AI Platform team (identity: @nexora/ai-platform)

Scope: the canonical, provider-independent SDK for building AI Agents.
Every future agent (HR, Projects, CRM, Finance, Knowledge, Workflow, ...)
extends `BaseAgent` from this package.

Rules:
- NO business logic. This package is generic and domain-agnostic.
- NO coupling to LLM providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Groq, ...),
  HTTP, frameworks, databases, or the Nexora domains/platform modules.
- Dependencies are limited to: @nexora/contracts, @nexora/shared,
  @nexora/config. Do not add others.
- Reuse the canonical contracts and shared utilities; never duplicate them.
- Contract changes require a compatibility review.
